    "name":  "LED Pendant Lamp - SKAGEN - for E27 LED",
    "reference":  "91740",
    "short_description":  "\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSKAGEN LED Pendant Lamp E27 – Natural and Elegant Design\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eAdd a warm and sophisticated touch to your spaces with the SKAGEN pendant lamp. Made from high-quality beech wood, it’s perfect for interiors seeking decorative and functional design. Compatible with E27 bulbs (not included), ideal for living rooms, dining areas, or bedrooms.\u003c/p\u003e",
    "description":  "\u003ch2\u003e\u003cb\u003eLED Pendant Lamp - SKAGEN - for E27 LED\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSKAGEN LED Pendant Lamp – Scandinavian Design in Beech Wood\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThe SKAGEN pendant lamp is the perfect choice for those looking for lighting with character and decorative design. Its beech wood structure adds a warm and natural touch, perfectly complementing modern, Nordic, or rustic styles.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eProduct Benefits:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h4\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNatural and Elegant Material\u003c/strong\u003e: High-quality beech wood offers a premium finish, adding warmth to any space.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eUniversal Compatibility\u003c/strong\u003e: Designed for E27 bulbs, with a wide range of options for color temperature and energy efficiency (bulb not included).\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDecorative Versatility\u003c/strong\u003e: Ideal for living rooms, dining areas, bedrooms, offices, or any indoor space requiring decorative lighting.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEasy Installation\u003c/strong\u003e: Includes everything needed for quick and secure installation, adaptable to ceilings of different heights.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTimeless Design\u003c/strong\u003e: The Scandinavian style combines simplicity and functionality, ensuring the lamp never goes out of fashion.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIdeal Uses:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h4\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eStylishly illuminate your dining area, creating a welcoming atmosphere for family gatherings.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDecorate spaces like cafés, offices, or studios with a modern and natural touch.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eComplement bedrooms or living rooms with warm and relaxing lighting.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eApproximate Dimensions:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eHeight: \u003cstrong\u003eadjustable up to 80 cm\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eSocket: \u003cstrong\u003eE27 standard\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e???? \u003cstrong\u003eNote\u003c/strong\u003e: Customize the light intensity and color with dimmable or differently toned E27 bulbs (bulb not included).\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis pendant lamp not only illuminates but transforms your spaces by merging design and functionality into a single product. Get it now! ????\u003c/p\u003e",
